2. [MAJOR] src/repl/weight.rs:152-162 — `profile_lines` silently drops timings for line numbers > `block.lines.len()`, losing data from the report total — VERIFIED: rows built only for 1..=block.lines.len() with no validation
3. [MAJOR] src/repl/mod.rs:1957-1960 — `execute_line` uses `code.lines()` for profile source lines, which splits incorrectly on newlines inside string literals, producing wrong source attribution — VERIFIED: str::lines() vs lexer line tracking mismatch
